\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Per-model paired tests on the procedural-Δ, under both judging paths. Both models have a positive Δ with bootstrap CI excluding zero in both paths. Under LLM-only re-judge, v2.0's $p{=}0.00098$ comfortably survives Bonferroni correction across the two tests (the deterministic-mixed $p{=}0.049$ would not). Neither test is replicated across seeds.}}{9}{table.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
